{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu059-e-sr-boyi-essay","title":"孙和论博弈之弊、命侍坐八人著论","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu059-a-cce5b670f78e27216d12","label":"正文","text":"群僚侍宴言及博弈，和以为妨事费日；乃命侍坐者八人各著论以矫之，中庶子韦曜退而论奏，和以示宾客","evidence":["santizhu059-q-ff32e62ab6df226e959a","santizhu059-q-c184df90f739b744b5e0"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0113","role":"宴上论博弈之弊并命八人著论、示宾客","evidence":["santizhu059-q-ff32e62ab6df226e959a","santizhu059-q-c184df90f739b744b5e0"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0049","role":"退而论奏","evidence":["santizhu059-q-ff32e62ab6df226e959a","santizhu059-q-c184df90f739b744b5e0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-ff32e62ab6df226e959a","santizhu059-q-c184df90f739b744b5e0"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-ff32e62ab6df226e959a","source_order":[59,137,0],"order":10452}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0049","name":"韦曜","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0113","name":"孙和","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu059-q-c184df90f739b744b5e0","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-13ba5111cb3887d69b67","layer":"original","quote":"后群僚侍宴，言及博弈，以为：“妨事费日而无益于用，劳精损思而终无所成；非所以进德修业，积累功绪者也〖11〗。且志士爱日惜力，君子慕其大者；高山景行〖12〗，耻非其次〖13〗。夫以天地长久，而人居其间，有白驹过隙之喻〖14〗；年齿一暮，荣华不再。凡所患者，在于人情所不能绝；诚能绝无益之欲，以奉德义之途；弃不急之务，以修功业之基：其于名行，岂不善哉！夫人情固不能无嬉娱；嬉娱之好，亦在于饮宴、琴书、射御之间。何必博弈，然后为欢？”","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":135,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":214,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-ff32e62ab6df226e959a","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-b064884a403e6393eb51","layer":"original","quote":"乃命侍坐者八人，各著论以矫之。于是中庶子韦曜退而论奏〖15〗，和以示宾客。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":136,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
